meta {
  name: Re-mint Sovereign Child Agent Assertion
  type: http
  seq: 166
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/agent/child/assertion
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{sessionToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "did": "{{childDid}}"
  }
}

docs {
  Renews an active child's identity_assertion — the short-lived credential it exchanges at the
  token endpoint. The child's DID, repo, and wallet-held rotation key are untouched.

  Parent-owner authority only: an agent-derived token is refused (403), a child belonging to
  another account is a uniform 404, and a revoked child is refused (403) rather than renewed.
  The granted scopes are re-clamped to the operator's current [agent_auth] granted_scopes.
}
